v0.3.0 (19th July 2026)
- The top command supports up to 100 processes now
- Printing single process
- Formatting in code was fixed
- Getting single process is faster (O(n) => O(1))

v0.2.2 (17th July 2026)
- Fixed charts Y-Axis display
- Fixed c_lflag from not being reverted after quit
- ''    ''      ''      ''      ''      after CTRL+C
- Compiles properly with -fsanitze=address and -fno-omit-frame-pointer

v0.2.1 (15th July 2026)
- Added Temperature detection
- New info and top command
- Stop and Help (and Monitor) have been moved to separate commands
- Codebase got cleaned
- Stricter checks added
- Detaching and Quitting process during renderer

v0.2.0 (3rd July 2026)
- Storing historical metrics and system snapshots
- Displaying RAM, CPU and Disk to Web UI
- Histories ~/.cherries-works/pulse/history/<- date ->
- Logs ~/.cherries-works/pulse/logs/<- date ->

v0.1.2 (30th June 2026)
- Moved to mutex locks instead of shms
- No hang, if deployed twice (check guards)
_Pulse checks if a service is already running before starting it_

v0.1.1 (26th June 2026)
- Daemon running separately
- Website fetching data via shm
- Directory creation at ~/.cherries-works/pulse/
- Added tests for shm
- Logging added
- No sleep(1) in main
- Better printing

